st price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\\\",\\\"features\\\":[\\\"Type — Acrylic door covered notice board, double door design\\\",\\\"Framing — Deluxe 45 mm triple aluminium framing\\\",\\\"Cover — Transparent acrylic door cover protecting notices from dust and handling\\\",\\\"Locking — Secure double-door system for controlled notice display\\\",\\\"Application — Offices, institutions, housing societies, hospitals and public areas\\\"],\\\"customisation\\\":null,\\\"media\\\":[{\\\"publicId\\\":\\\"plusmark/products/deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-double-door\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Deluxe 45 mm ADC Notice Board (Double Door) - Deluxe Standard ADC Notice Board by Plusmark\\\",\\\"width\\\":1400,\\\"height\\\":1400,\\\"source\\\":\\\"product\\\"}],\\\"videoId\\\":null,\\\"variants\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-double-door--3-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-double-door\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-DS-ACR-3X4FT0\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"3-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"3 x 4 ft\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":122,\\\"heightCm\\\":91},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":2580,\\\"compareAtInr\\\":null,\\\"stock\\\":null,\\\"trackInventory\\\":false,\\\"available\\\":true,\\\"leadTimeDays\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-double-door--4-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-double-door\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-DS-ACR-4X4FT0\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"4-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"4 x 4 ft\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":122,\\\"heightCm\\\":122},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":3240,\\\"compareAtInr\\\":null,\\\"stock\\\":null,\\\"trackInventory\\\":false,\\\"available\\\":true,\\\"leadTimeDays\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-double-door--5-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-double-door\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-DS-ACR-5X4FT0\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"5-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"label\\\":\