 to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\\\n\\\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\\\",\\\"features\\\":[\\\"Material — Regular quality materials\\\",\\\"Design — Electroplated Chrome Corners for a clean, professional look\\\",\\\"Surface — High Gloss Melamine Writing Surface, smooth and easy to clean\\\",\\\"Durability — Dependable for regular use\\\"],\\\"customisation\\\":null,\\\"media\\\":[{\\\"publicId\\\":\\\"plusmark/products/deluxe-standard-white-board\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Deluxe Standard White Board - Deluxe Standard Whiteboard by Plusmark\\\",\\\"width\\\":1400,\\\"height\\\":1400,\\\"source\\\":\\\"product\\\"}],\\\"videoId\\\":null,\\\"variants\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"deluxe-standard-white-board--3-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"deluxe-standard-white-board\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-DS-WHI-3X4FT0\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"3-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"3 x 4 ft\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":122,\\\"heightCm\\\":91},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":2580,\\\"compareAtInr\\\":null,\\\"stock\\\":null,\\\"trackInventory\\\":false,\\\"available\\\":true,\\\"leadTimeDays\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"deluxe-standard-white-board--4-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"deluxe-standard-white-board\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-DS-WHI-4X4FT0\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"4-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"4 x 4 ft\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":122,\\\"heightCm\\\":122},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":3240,\\\"compareAtInr\\\":null,\\\"stock\\\":null,\\\"trackInventory\\\":false,\\\"available\\\":true,\\\"leadTimeDays\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"deluxe-standard-white-board--5-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"deluxe-standard-white-board\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-DS-WHI-5X4FT0\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"5-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"5 x 4 ft\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":122,\\\"h