uent and heavy pin usage\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Durability\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Highest grade, designed for long-term institutional use\\\"}],\\\"enquiryOnly\\\":false,\\\"needsData\\\":false,\\\"published\\\":true,\\\"featured\\\":true,\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-01-01T09:30:00.000Z\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"metallic-premium-white-board\\\",\\\"slug\\\":\\\"metallic-premium-white-board\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Metallic Premium White Board\\\",\\\"categoryId\\\":\\\"white-boards\\\",\\\"seriesId\\\":\\\"metallic-premium\\\",\\\"subcategoryIds\\\":[\\\"white-boards-non-magnetic\\\"],\\\"surface\\\":\\\"High Gloss Marker Grade HPL Sheet\\\",\\\"frame\\\":\\\"Aluminium anodized frame, heavy-duty\\\",\\\"corners\\\":\\\"Signature Dual-Tone corners - red cap over black connector\\\",\\\"magnetic\\\":false,\\\"doubleSided\\\":false,\\\"boardType\\\":\\\"non-magnetic\\\",\\\"surfaceKind\\\":\\\"marker\\\",\\\"usage\\\":\\\"High-end offices, educational institutions and professional environments\\\",\\\"blurb\\\":\\\"Metallic Premium White Board: High Gloss Marker Grade HPL Sheet · Aluminium anodized frame, heavy-duty. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The Metallic Premium White Board uses high-quality, durable materials with a High Gloss Marker Grade HPL Sheet. Heavy-duty framing with Signature Dual-Tone Corners gives it a solid, professional build.\\\\n\\\\nThe ultra-smooth, high-gloss surface is made for effortless writing and easy erasing. It suits high-end offices, educational institutions and professional environments, and is extremely long-lasting and highly resistant to wear and tear.\\\\n\\\\nStandard sizes on this page are 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\\\n\\\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\\\",\\\"features\\\":[\\\"Material — High-quality, durable materials with High Gloss Marker Grade HPL Sheet\\\",\\\"Design — Heavy-duty framing with Signature Dual-Tone Corners\\\",\\\"Surface — Ultra-smooth, high-gloss surface for effortless writing and easy erasing\\\",\\\"Durability — Extremely long-lasting and highly resistant to wear and tear\\\"],\\\"customisation\\\":null,\\\"media\\\":[{\\\"publicId\\\":\\\"plusmark/products/metallic-premium-white-board\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Metallic Premium White Board - Metallic Premium Whiteboard by Plusmark\\\",\\\"width\\\":1400,\\\"height\\\":1400,\\\"source\\\":\\\"product\\\"}],\\\"videoId\\\":\\\"plusmark/videos/metallic-premium-white-board\\\",\\\"variants\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"metallic-premium-white-board--3-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"metallic-premium-white-board\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-MP-WHI-3X4FT0\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"3-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"3 x 4 ft\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":122,\\\"heightCm\\\":91},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":4020,\\\"compareAtInr\\\":null,\\\"stock\\\":null,\\\"trackInventory\\\":false,\\\"available\\\":true,\\\"leadTimeDays\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"metallic-premium-white-board--4-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"metallic-premium-white-board\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-MP-WHI-4X4FT0\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"4-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"4 x 4 ft\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":122,\\\"heightCm\\\":122},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":5060,\\\"compareAtInr\\\":null,\\\"stock\\\":null,\\\"trackInventory\\\":false,\\\"available\\\":true,\\\"leadTimeDays\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"metallic-premium-white-board--5-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"metallic-premium-white-board\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-MP-WHI-5X4FT0\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"5-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"5 x 4 ft\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":122,\\\"heightCm\\\":152},\\\"priceMode\\