s the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\\\",\\\"features\\\":[\\\"Base — Crystal-tint acrylic with a modern transparent colour\\\",\\\"Edge — Rounded corners for safety and comfort\\\",\\\"Clip — Chrome electroplated with anti-rust protection\\\",\\\"Rivets — Dual-cap rivet system for a balanced, neat appearance\\\",\\\"Sizes — Two sizes\\\"],\\\"customisation\\\":null,\\\"media\\\":[{\\\"publicId\\\":\\\"plusmark/products/crystal-colour-base-clipboard\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Crystal Colour Base Clipboard - Clipboard by Plusmark\\\",\\\"width\\\":1400,\\\"height\\\":1400,\\\"source\\\":\\\"product\\\"}],\\\"videoId\\\":null,\\\"variants\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"crystal-colour-base-clipboard--standard-size\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"crystal-colour-base-clipboard\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-STD-CLI-STANDA\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"standard-size\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Standard size\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":null,\\\"heightCm\\\":null},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":390,\\\"compareAtInr\\\":null,\\\"stock\\\":null,\\\"trackInventory\\\":false,\\\"available\\\":true,\\\"leadTimeDays\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"crystal-colour-base-clipboard--made-to-order\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"crystal-colour-base-clipboard\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-STD-CLI-MADETO\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"made-to-order\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Made to order\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":null,\\\"heightCm\\\":null},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":390,\\\"compareAtInr\\\":null,\\\"stock\\\":null,\\\"trackInventory\\\":false,\\\"available\\\":true,\\\"leadTimeDays\\\":null}],\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"gstRatePercent\\\":12,\\\"hsnCode\\\":null,\\\"minimumOrderQuantity\\\":1,\\\"bulkSuggestionQuantity\\\":10,\\\"specs\\\":[{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Base\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Crystal-Tint Acrylic Base — Modern Transparent Colour with Elegant Appeal\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Edge\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Rounded Edge — Soft Rounded Corners for Safety \\u0026 Comfort\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Clip\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Chrome Electroplated Clip — Anti-Rust Protection\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Rivets\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Dual-Cap Rivet System — Balanced \\u0026 Neat Appearance\\\"}],\\\"enquiryOnly\\\":false,\\\"needsData\\\":true,\\\"published\\\":true,\\\"featured\\\":false,\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-01-01T09:30:00.000Z\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"dry-wipe-schedule-board\\\",\\\"slug\\\":\\\"dry-wipe-schedule-board\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Dry Wipe Schedule Board\\\",\\\"categoryId\\\":\\\"schedule-boards\\\",\\\"seriesId\\\":null,\\\"subcategoryIds\\\":[],\\\"surface\\\":null,\\\"frame\\\":null,\\\"corners\\\":null,\\\"magnetic\\\":false,\\\"doubleSided\\\":false,\\\"boardType\\\":\\\"n/a\\\",\\\"surfaceKind\\\":\\\"marker\\\",\\\"usage\\\":\\\"Custom schedule boards made to the customer's design\\\",\\\"blurb\\\":\\\"Dry Wipe Schedule Board. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The Dry Wipe Schedule Board is made in any design and any size. Before ordering, Plusmark needs the quantity, the sizes, and a sketch of the board as per your requirements — the sketch can be supplied in CorelDRAW, Photoshop or a Word file.\\\\n\\\\nWhere Plusmark prepares the design itself, additional charges apply.\\\\n\\\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\\\",\\\"features\\\":[\\\"Design — Any design or any size\\\",\\\"Before ordering — quantity, sizes and a sketch of the board\\\",\\\"Sketch format — CorelDRAW, Photoshop or Word file\\\",\\\"Design service — additional charges when Plusmark prepares the design\\\"],\\\"customisation\\\":\\\"Any design and any size. Share the quantity, sizes and a sketch (CorelDRAW, Photos