 the back for chalk. The non-magnetic, easy-to-clean surfaces sit in a premium aluminium anodised frame with ABS dual-tone edges, and quick wall-mount installation lets the board hang horizontally or vertically.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Surface — Marker Grade HPL Sheet\",\"Frame — Ribbed aluminium anodized frame\",\"Corners — ABS Dual-Tone corners\",\"Non-magnetic face\",\"Two writing faces on one frame\",\"Sizes made — 2 x 3 ft, 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft\",\"Custom sizes made to order\",\"Pan-India dispatch from Ahmedabad\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/eco-premium-both-side-board\",\"alt\":\"Eco Premium Double-Sided Board - Eco Premium Double-Sided Board by Plusmark\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":1400,\"source\":\"product\"}],\"videoId\":\"plusmark/videos/eco-premium-both-side\",\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"eco-premium-both-side-board--2-x-3-ft\",\"productId\":\"eco-premium-both-side-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-EP-DOU-2X3FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"2-x-3-ft\",\"label\":\"2 x 3 ft\",\"widthCm\":91,\"heightCm\":61},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":1900,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"eco-premium-both-side-board--3-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"eco-premium-both-side-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-EP-DOU-3X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"3-x-4-ft\",\"label\":\"3 x 4 ft\",\"widthCm\":122,\"heightCm\":91},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":3100,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"eco-premium-both-side-board--4-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"eco-premium-both-side-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-EP-DOU-4X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"4-x-4-ft\",\"label\":\"4 x 4 ft\",\"widthCm\":122,\"heightCm\":122},\