:\"notice-boards\",\"seriesId\":\"eco-premium\",\"subcategoryIds\":[\"notice-boards-pin-up\"],\"surface\":\"2 mm Blazer Cloth\",\"frame\":\"Ribbed aluminium anodized frame\",\"corners\":\"ABS Dual-Tone corners\",\"magnetic\":false,\"doubleSided\":false,\"boardType\":\"n/a\",\"surfaceKind\":\"pin-up\",\"usage\":\"Classrooms, offices and institutions\",\"blurb\":\"Eco Premium Notice Board: 2 mm Blazer Cloth · Ribbed aluminium anodized frame. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\",\"description\":\"The Eco Premium Notice Board uses premium-grade construction for reliable performance. Its 2 mm Blazer Cloth surface suits regular institutional use over a soft core made for repeated pinning.\\n\\nIt is long-lasting with consistent performance. Available colours: Royal & Navy Blue, Almond & Dark Green, Red, Maroon, Light Gray and Dark Gray.\\n\\nStandard sizes on this page are 2 x 3 ft, 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Material — Premium-grade construction for reliable performance\",\"Surface — 2 mm Blazer Cloth suitable for regular institutional use\",\"Core — Soft core material for repeated pinning\",\"Durability — Long-lasting with consistent performance\",\"Colours — Royal & Navy Blue, Almond & Dark Green, Red, Maroon, Light Gray, Dark Gray\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/eco-premium-notice-board\",\"alt\":\"Eco Premium Notice Board - Eco Premium Notice Board by Plusmark\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":1400,\"source\":\"product\"}],\"videoId\":\"plusmark/videos/eco-premium-notice-board\",\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"eco-premium-not