face is made for continuous writing and frequent cleaning, with consistent performance over a very long product life.\\n\\nIt is finished in an aluminium frame with Signature Dual-Tone Corners. Where magnetic use is not required, the non-magnetic Metallic Premium boards are a more economical alternative with similar writing performance.\\n\\nStandard sizes on this page are 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Surface — Ceramic steel / porcelain enamel steel for chalk writing\",\"Product life — Designed for very long life under regular institutional use\",\"Performance — Hard, non-porous surface for continuous writing and frequent cleaning\",\"Finish — Smooth writing surface with consistent performance over time\",\"Maintenance — Easy to clean and maintain for daily classroom use\",\"Design — Aluminium frame with Signature Dual-Tone Corners\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/metallic-premium-chalk-board\",\"alt\":\"Metallic Premium Ceramic Chalk Board - Metallic Premium Chalkboard by Plusmark\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":1400,\"source\":\"product\"}],\"videoId\":null,\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"metallic-premium-ceramic-chalk-board--3-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"metallic-premium-ceramic-chalk-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-MP-CHA-3X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"3-x-4-ft\",\"label\":\"3 x 4 ft\",\"widthCm\":122,\"heightCm\":91},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":4020,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"metallic-premium-ceramic-chalk-board--4-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"metallic-premium-ceramic-chalk-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-MP-CHA-4X4FT0\",\"s