on-magnetic\",\"surfaceKind\":\"marker\",\"usage\":\"High-end offices, educational institutions and professional environments\",\"blurb\":\"Metallic Premium White Board: High Gloss Marker Grade HPL Sheet · Aluminium anodized frame, heavy-duty. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\",\"description\":\"The Metallic Premium White Board uses high-quality, durable materials with a High Gloss Marker Grade HPL Sheet. Heavy-duty framing with Signature Dual-Tone Corners gives it a solid, professional build.\\n\\nThe ultra-smooth, high-gloss surface is made for effortless writing and easy erasing. It suits high-end offices, educational institutions and professional environments, and is extremely long-lasting and highly resistant to wear and tear.\\n\\nStandard sizes on this page are 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Material — High-quality, durable materials with High Gloss Marker Grade HPL Sheet\",\"Design — Heavy-duty framing with Signature Dual-Tone Corners\",\"Surface — Ultra-smooth, high-gloss surface for effortless writing and easy erasing\",\"Durability — Extremely long-lasting and highly resistant to wear and tear\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/metallic-premium-white-board\",\"alt\":\"Metallic Premium White Board - Metallic Premium Whiteboard by Plusmark\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":1400,\"source\":\"product\"}],\"videoId\":\"plusmark/videos/metallic-premium-white-board\",\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"metallic-premium-white-board--3-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"metallic-premium-white-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-MP-WHI-3X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"