y-duty framing with Signature Dual-Tone Corners\"},{\"label\":\"Frame\",\"value\":\"Aluminium Anodized Frame\"},{\"label\":\"Surface\",\"value\":\"Ultra-smooth, high-gloss surface for effortless writing and easy erasing\"},{\"label\":\"Durability\",\"value\":\"Extremely long-lasting and highly resistant to wear and tear\"}],\"enquiryOnly\":false,\"needsData\":false,\"published\":true,\"featured\":true,\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-01T09:30:00.000Z\"},{\"id\":\"acrylic-folder-display-board\",\"slug\":\"acrylic-folder-display-board\",\"name\":\"Acrylic Folder Display Board\",\"categoryId\":\"specialty-boards\",\"seriesId\":null,\"subcategoryIds\":[],\"surface\":\"Transparent acrylic front folders\",\"frame\":\"Strong aluminium frame\",\"corners\":null,\"magnetic\":false,\"doubleSided\":false,\"boardType\":\"n/a\",\"surfaceKind\":\"other\",\"usage\":\"Charts, reports, SOPs and production data\",\"blurb\":\"Acrylic Folder Display Board: Transparent acrylic front folders · Strong aluminium frame. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\",\"description\":\"The Acrylic Folder Display Board uses transparent front folders for easy document viewing. It is made for charts, reports, SOPs and production data, and papers can be inserted and replaced quickly.\\n\\nFolder size and quantity are as per customer requirement, and a strong aluminium frame makes the board suitable for industrial use.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Visibility — Transparent front folders for easy document viewing\",\"Display — Ideal for charts, reports, SOPs and production data\",\"Access — Papers can be inserted and replaced quickly\",\"Custom layout — Folder size and quantity as per customer requirement\",\"Frame — Strong aluminium frame suitable for industrial use\"],\"customisation\":\"Folder size and quantity are made to customer requirement.\",\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/acrylic-folder-display-board\",\"alt\":\"Acrylic Folder Display Board - Specialty Display Board by Plusmark\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":1400,\"source\":\"product\"}],\"videoId\":null,\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"acrylic-folder-display-board--standard-size\",\"productId\":\"acrylic-folder-display-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-STD-SPE-STANDA\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"standard-size\",\"label\":\"Standard size\",\"widthCm\":null,\"heightCm\":null},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":2920,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"acrylic-folder-display-board--made-to-order\",\"productId\":\"acrylic-folder-display-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-STD-SPE-MADETO\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"made-to-order\",\"label\":\"Made to order\",\"widthCm\":null,\"heightCm\":null},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":2920,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null}],\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"gstRatePercent\":12,\"hsnCode\":null,\"minimumOrderQuantity\":1,\"bulkSuggestionQuantity\":10,\"specs\":[{\"label\":\"Folders\",\"value\":\"Transparent front folders\"},{\"label\":\"Layout\",\"value\":\"Folder size and quantity as per customer requirement\"},{\"label\":\"Frame\",\"value\":\"Strong aluminium frame suitable for industrial use\"}],\"enquiryOnly\":false,\"needsData\":true,\"published\":true,\"featured\":false,\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-01T09:30:00.000Z\"},{\"id\":\"combination-board\",\"slug\":\"combination-board\",\"name\":\"Combination Board\",\"categoryId\":\"notice-boards\",\"seriesId\":null,\"subcategoryIds\":[],\"surface\":\"Dry wipe white board one side, fabric notice board on the other\",\"frame\":null,\"corners\":null,\"magnetic\":false,\"doubleSided\":false,\"boardType\":\"n/a\",\"surfaceKind\":\"pin-up\",\"usage\":\"Marker writing and pin-up display in one board\",\"blurb\":\"Combination Board: Dry wipe white board one side, fabric notice board on the other. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\",\"description\":\"The Combination Board carries a dry wipe white board on one side and a fabric notice board on the other, so marker writing and pin-up display sit in a single board.\\n\\nThe marker face erases cleanly, while the durable fabric takes repeated pinning and removal without losing grip. It is available in Metallic Premium, Eco Premium and Deluxe frame variants.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Surface — Dry wipe white board on one side, fabric notice board on the other\",\"Function — Marker writing plus pin-up display in a single board\",\"Performance — Smooth marker writing with easy erase and a durable fabric surface for repeated pin use\",\"Durability — Long-lasting surface performance for regular notice display\",\"Design options — Metallic Premium, Eco Premium and Deluxe frame variants\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/combination-board\",\"alt\":\"Combination Board - Notice Board by Plusmark\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":1400,\"source\":\"product\"}],\"videoId\":null,\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"combination-board--standard-size\",\"productId\":\"combination-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-STD-NOT-STANDA\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"standard-size\",\"label\":\"Standard size\",\"widthCm\":null,\"heightCm\":null},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":2580,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"combination-board--made-to-order\",\"productId\":\"combination-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-STD-NOT-MADETO\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"made-to-order\",\"label\":\"Made to order\",\"widthCm\":null,\"heightCm\":null},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":2580,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null}],\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"gstRatePercent\":12,\"hsnCode\":null,\"minimumOrderQuantity\":1,\"bulkSuggestionQuantity\":10,\"specs\":[{\"label\":\"Surface\",\"value\":\"Dry wipe white board on one side and fabric notice board on the other\"},{\"label\":\"Functionality\",\"value\":\"Writing with markers plus pin-up display in a single board\"},{\"label\":\"Customization\",\"value\":\"Allows frequent pinning and removal without surface damage or loss of grip\"},{\"label\":\"Performance\",\"value\":\"Smooth marker writing with easy erase and durable fabric surface for repeated pin use\"},{\"label\":\"Durability\",\"value\":\"Long-lasting surface performance for regular notice display use\"}],\"enquiryOnly\":false,\"needsData\":true,\"published\":true,\"featured\":false,\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-01T09:30:00.000Z\"},{\"id\":\"cork-notice-board\",\"slug\":\"cork-notice-board\",\"name\":\"Cork Notice Board\",\"categoryId\":\"notice-boards\",\"seriesId\":null,\"subcategoryIds\":[\"notice-boards-pin-up\"],\"surface\":\"High-quality natural cork\",\"frame\":null,\"corners\":null,\"magnetic\":false,\"doubleSided\":false,\"boardType\":\"n/a\",\"surfaceKind\":\"pin-up\",\"usage\":\"Regular notice display with repeated pin use\",\"blurb\":\"Cork Notice Board: High-quality natural cork. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\",\"description\":\"The Cork Notice Board uses a high-quality natural cork surface over a soft, resilient base built for smooth pin insertion and firm holding. It allows frequent pinning and removal without surface damage or loss of grip.\\n\\nThe uniform cork texture gives a neat, professional appearance, and the surface is long-lasting for regular notice display. It is available in Metallic Premium, Eco Premium and Deluxe frame variants.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Surface — High-quality natural cork suitable for repeated pin use\",\"Core — Soft and resilient base for smooth pin insertion and firm holding\",\"Performance — Frequent pinning and removal without surface damage or loss of grip\",\"Finish — Uniform cork texture with a neat and professional appearance\",\"Durability — Long-lasting performance for regular notice display\",\"Design options — Metallic Premium, Eco Premium and Deluxe frame variants\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/cork-notice-board\",\"alt\":\"Cork Notice Board - Notice Board by Plusmark\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":1400,\"source\":\"product\"}],\"videoId\":null,\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"cork-notice-board--standard-size\",\"productId\":\"cork-notice-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-STD-NOT-STANDA\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"standard-size\",\"label\":\"Standard size\",\"widthCm\":null,\"heightCm\":null},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":3070,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"cork-notice-board--made-to-order\",\"productId\":\"cork-notice-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-STD-NOT-MADETO\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"made-to-order\",\"label\":\"Made to order\",\"widthCm\":null,\"heightCm\":null},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":3070,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null}],\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"gstRatePercent\":12,\"hsnCode\":null,\"minimumOrderQuantity\":1,\"bulkSuggestionQuantity\":10,\"specs\":[{\"label\":\"Surface\",\"value\":\"High-quality natural cork surface suitable for repeated pin use\"},{\"label\":\"Core\",\"value\":\"Soft and resilient base material designed specially for smooth pin insertion and firm holding\"},{\"label\":\"Performance\",\"value\":\"Allows frequent pinning and removal without surface damage or loss of grip\"},{\"label\":\"Finish\",\"value\":\"Uniform cork texture with a neat and professional appearance\"},{\"label\":\"Durability\",\"value\":\"Long-lasting surface performance for regular notice display use\"}],\"enquiryOnly\":false,\"needsData\":true,\"published\":true,\"featured\":true,\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-01T09:30:00.000Z\"},{\"id\":\"crystal-clear-base-clipboard\",\"slug\":\"crystal-clear-base-clipboard\",\"name\":\"Crystal Clear Base Clipboard\",\"categoryId\":\"clipboards\",\"seriesId\":null,\"subcategoryIds\":[\"clipboards-acrylic\"],\"surface\":null,\"frame\":null,\"corners\":null,\"magnetic\":false,\"doubleSided\":false,\"boardType\":\"n/a\",\"surfaceKind\":\"other\",\"usage\":\"Clipboard use with a clear acrylic base\",\"blurb\":\"Crystal Clear Base Clipboard. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\",\"description\":\"The Crystal Clear Base Clipboard uses a crystal-clear acrylic base with glass-like clarity and a modern appeal. The chrome electroplated clip has a rust-resistant finish, and dual-side cap rivets keep a uniform look on both sides.\\n\\nThe heavy-duty clear acrylic has high impact strength and is shatter-resistant. It is available in two sizes and four variants.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Base — Crystal clear acrylic with glass-like clarity\",\"Clip — Chrome electroplated, rust-resistant finish\",\"Rivets — Dual-side cap rivets for a uniform look on both sides\",\"Build — Heavy-duty clear acrylic with high impact strength and shatter resistance\",\"Options — Two sizes and four variants\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/pro